<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Jews</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Jews are a people and religious community descended from the ancient <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/israelites">Israelites</a>. Jewish communities lived in many empires, often as protected minorities. They served in the bureaucracy of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fatimid-caliphate">Fatimid Caliphate</a>, formed a self-governing community under the Ottoman <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/millet-system">millet system</a>, and suffered persecution in the late <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/safavid-empire">Safavid Empire</a>.</p></div>
